{"4992660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scawy Game", "steam_appid": 4992660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scawy Game</strong> is an absurd first-person parody horror game about Kingven Sting, a failed horror writer who buys a cheap asset house in the middle of nowhere to write his next book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He arrives with his daughter and dog. <br>The house seems  cheap, <strong>suspiciously familiar</strong>, and almost normal. <br>It comes with one simple responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/5b321372f5b767e027a696e36855019a.poster.avif?t=1787578516\" width=750 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/5b321372f5b767e027a696e36855019a.webm?t=1787578516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/5b321372f5b767e027a696e36855019a.mp4?t=1787578516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Survive 4 days and 4 nights in the house, feed the cats, unlock bizarre skills, and try to defeat the entity hiding inside.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE SIMPLE TASK: FEED THE CATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The previous owner had only one request before she died: <strong>feed her three cats every day.</strong><br>Find them.<br> Feed them. <br> Try not to question why one of them is named Chi Gevara.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT YOU'LL ACTUALLY BE DOING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore a suspiciously normal home <br>- Complete strange objectives<br>- Squeeze an inflatable chicken to reduce panic<br>- Unlock bizarre skills <br>- Survive 4 days and 4 nights <br>- Try to defeat the entity hiding inside the house<strong> <i>(</i></strong><i>there's always one)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/8297e416fb0348a5ace0027250e8be06.poster.avif?t=1787578516\" width=750 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/8297e416fb0348a5ace0027250e8be06.webm?t=1787578516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/8297e416fb0348a5ace0027250e8be06.mp4?t=1787578516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/baa02142d4d31bbac4ba261e9f96cad8.poster.avif?t=1787578516\" width=750 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/baa02142d4d31bbac4ba261e9f96cad8.webm?t=1787578516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/baa02142d4d31bbac4ba261e9f96cad8.mp4?t=1787578516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HORROR, HUMOR, SARCASM, AND PARODY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We like horror. We also like dumb jokes. Scawy Game combines both: sarcasm, parody, absurd situations, and scares that do not always work the way they should. Keep an open mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992660/extras/cf2d286a2de7ae0156ea7144e874856e.poster.avif?t=1787578516\" width=750 height=348 ><source src